01xehWlhjXr2sNhL\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc372db80001nYzM9KQsHaw667\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"snapshot\":\"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n28: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690520675,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_bYSrW7Hmuh3LGM1WpUXkiH9Y\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/agents/deep-research.md\",\"limit\":300},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/agents/deep-research.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: ---\\n2: name: deep-research\\n3: description: \\\"Autonomous deep research agent executing single iteration cycles with externalized state\\\"\\n4: mode: subagent\\n5: temperature: 0.1\\n6: permission:\\n7:   read: allow\\n8:   write: allow\\n9:   edit: allow\\n10:   bash: allow\\n11:   grep: allow\\n12:   glob: allow\\n13:   webfetch: allow\\n14:   memory: allow\\n15:   chrome_devtools: deny\\n16:   task: deny\\n17:   list: allow\\n18:   patch: deny\\n19:   external_directory: allow\\n20: ---\\n21: \\n22: # The Deep Researcher: Autonomous Iteration Agent\\n23: \\n24: Executes exactly ONE research iteration in the `/deep:research` loop. It reads externalized state, performs focused research, writes cited findings to packet files, appends one iteration record, and returns a concise completion report.\\n25: \\n26: **Path Convention**: Use only `.opencode/agents/*.md` as the canonical runtime path reference.\\n27: \\n28: **Hook-Injected Advisor Context**: Treat hook-injected skill-advisor recommendations as routing hints only. They never override explicit user instructions, active command workflow, scope gates, runtime permissions, agent boundaries, or required skill loading. If advisor context conflicts with the dispatch prompt or verified local files, prefer the dispatch prompt plus file evidence and report the conflict.\\n29: \\n30: **Efficiency governor (the per-turn hook does not reach sub-agents — apply it here)**: reason about the problem, not yourself; lead with the result and act rather than narrate (batch tool ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n29: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690520675,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_Z8G4JdWzMQyngt7JgnP9jPdM\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/SKILL.md\",\"limit\":500},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/SKILL.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: ---\\n2: name: cli-opencode\\n3: description: \\\"OpenCode CLI orchestrator: external dispatch, in-OpenCode parallel sessions, cross-AI handback with full runtime context.\\\"\\n4: allowed-tools: [Bash, Read, Glob, Grep]\\n5: version: 1.4.0.0\\n6: hard_rules:\\n7:   - id: stdin-redirect-required\\n8:     check: stdin-redirect-required\\n9:     message: \\\"Ad-hoc `opencode run` MUST close/redirect stdin (`</dev/null`) — omitting it can hang indefinitely at 0% CPU with zero output.\\\"\\n10:     severity: warn\\n11:   - id: no-bare-agent-general\\n12:     check: no-bare-agent-general\\n13:     message: \\\"Never pass a bare top-level `--agent general`; opencode rejects it on run.\\\"\\n14:     severity: warn\\n15:   - id: command-flag-for-slash-prompt\\n16:     check: command-flag-for-slash-prompt\\n17:     message: \\\"A slash-command-shaped prompt (`/family:name ...`) needs `--command <family>/<name>`, else opencode silently delivers the slash text as raw prose.\\\"\\n18:     severity: warn\\n19:   - id: share-requires-confirmation\\n20:     check: share-requires-confirmation\\n21:     message: \\\"`--share` publishes the session and requires prior operator confirmation.\\\"\\n22:     severity: warn\\n23: ---\\n24: \\n25: <!-- Keywords: opencode, opencode-cli, opencode-run, cross-ai, spec-kit-runtime, plugin-runtime, parallel-sessions, share-url, detached-session, agent-delegation, deepseek, openai, minimax, minimax-coding-plan, minimax-m3, token-plan, xiaomi, xiaom... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n30: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690520693,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_pdPlk6BejPSX1lahLjTeO2zy\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":260},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: #!/usr/bin/env node\\n2: \\n3: // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\\n4: // ║ Deep-Loop Runtime — Fan-Out CLI Lineage Pool Runner                      ║\\n5: // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\\n6: // ║ Input:  CLI args (--spec-folder, --loop-type, --fanout-config-json,      ║\\n7: // ║         --base-artifact-dir).                                            ║\\n8: // ║ Output: JSON to stdout.                                                  ║\\n9: // ║ Exit:   0=all ok, 1=script error, 2=some failed, 3=all failed.          ║\\n10: // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\\n11: \\n12: 'use strict';\\n13: \\n14: // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n15: // 1. IMPORTS\\n16: // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n17: \