lopment/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/receipts-and-effect-recovery/boundary-receipts.ts\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/receipts-and-effect-recovery/index.ts\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/receipts-and-effect-recovery/certification.ts\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtim... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690496202,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"grep\",\"callID\":\"call_52Z6TzDJnUQ7tzUkDXn6zLCr\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"fanout-run\\\\.cjs\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public\"},\"output\":\"Found 100 matches (more matches available)\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-devin/SKILL.md:\\n  Line 171: This packet owns user-facing routing, the `command -v devin` availability probe, prompt construction, and the self-invocation guard. Actual process construction and execution delegate to the already-shipped deep-loop runtime at `../../system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs`, using executor kind `cli-devin`.\\n\\n  Line 327: 2. Delegate orchestrated execution to `../../system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs` with executor kind `cli-devin`; never build a second adapter in this packet.\\n\\n  Line 434: - **Execution**: Shared deep-loop runtime (`../../system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs`)\\n\\n\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-cursor/SKILL.md:\\n  Line 179: This packet owns user-facing routing, the `command -v cursor-agent` availability probe, prompt construction, and the self-invocation guard. Actual process construction and execution delegate to the already-shipped deep-loop runtime at `../../system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs`, using executor kind `cli-cursor`.\\n\\n  Line 241: The enforced allowlist (10 ids) and the per-task rationale table live inline in [references/cli-reference.md](./references/cli-reference.md) §5 and [references/providers-and-models.md](./references/providers-and-models.md) §2. Enforced at the runtime layer (`CURSOR_SUPPORTED_MODELS` in `executor-config.ts`, checked by `fanout-run.cjs` and `dispatch-model.cjs` before any command is... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690496296,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_tWypincibT3SsaXX4CH6uUqm\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\".opencode/commands/**/*workflow*\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public\"},\"output\":\"No files found\",\"metadata\":{\"count\":0,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"\",\"time\":{\"start\":1785690495992,\"end\":1785690496291}},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"fc_0dc797ad73e3576f016a6f797fd5208191913140257ce0e09d\"}},\"id\":\"prt_fc3729bf1001pAVMRJMC6YI6Of\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc37273d9001GHhtYnf0Y3ic94\"}}\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1785690497518,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fc372a1ec0019L5wWv5AN6Q9U4\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc37273d9001GHhtYnf0Y3ic94\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":58432,\"input\":25741,\"output\":198,\"reasoning\":237,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":32256}},\"cost\":0}}","truncated":true,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/001-deep-research/research/lineages/luna-fast/logs/fanout-lineage.out","text":"{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1785690458767,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fc3720a8c00161Y5Jt5G11CsCn\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc371e926001RCeck0aAdKxcog\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"snapshot\":\"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690463720,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"skill\",\"callID\":\"call_WIqZA7zMBeAbpCOgy9dEOSgd\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"name\":\"deep-research\"},\"output\":\"<skill_content name=\\\"deep-research\\\">\\n# Skill: deep-research\\n\\n<!-- Keywords: autoresearch, deep-research, iterative-research, autonomous-loop, convergence-detection, externalized-state, fresh-context, research-agent, JSONL-state, strategy-file -->\\n\\n# Autonomous Deep Research Loop\\n\\nNote: `Task` is allowed for the command executor that manages the loop. The `@deep-research` agent itself is LEAF-only and does not dispatch sub-agents.\\n\\nIterative research protocol with fresh context per iteration, externalized state, and convergence detection for deep technical investigation.\\n\\nRuntime path resolution: OpenCode/Copilot runtime uses `.opencode/agents/*.md`; Claude runtime uses `.claude/agents/*.md`.\\n\\nOperator contract precedence for this skill surface (highest first): command entrypoint syntax in `.opencode/commands/deep/research.md`; convergence math in `references/convergence/convergence.md` and the deep-research YAML workflow; runtime agent inventories from the checked-in runtime directories above.\\n\\n### Convergence Threshold Semantics\\n\\n**Default:** 0.05 on newInfoRatio (fully-new=1.0, partially-new=0.5, +0.10 simplicity bonus, capped 1.0)\\n\\n**Semantic:** `convergenceThreshold` compares newly discovered information against accumulated research knowledge with negative-knowledge emphasis. Lower = more iterations / higher signal threshold.\\n\\n**NOT INTERCHANGEABLE with siblings:**\\n- `deep-review` uses 0.10 default on weighted P0/P1/P2 severity ratio\\n- `deep-ai-council` uses 0.20 default on adjudicator-verdict stability\\n\\nCarrying threshold expectations across siblings will cause unexpected iteration counts; see this skill's changelog/decision records for the parity research confirming thresholds do not carry across ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1785690465113,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fc3722356001BXnCmtvFi9iI9K\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc371e926001RCeck0aAdKxcog\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":23943,\"input\":23680,\"output\":21,\"reasoning\":242,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":0}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1785690468916,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fc37232320011tDYwP13Khg0F4\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc37228d1001gfkvceWgWuQU7z\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"snapshot\":\"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690474297,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_wfkXl0CFvZbb8vWYSlecBct7\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\".opencode/commands/deep/**/*\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public\"},\"output\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-model-benchmark-confirm.yaml\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-model-benchmark-auto.yaml\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-skill-benchmark-auto.yaml\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-model-benchmark-presentation.txt\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-alignment-auto.yaml\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-alignment-presentation.txt\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-confirm.yaml\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-command-benchmark-confirm.yaml\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-command-benchmark-presentation.txt\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-command-benchmark-auto.yaml\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-agent-impro... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690474305,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_Kj9OIbWYN9sx4AsT7WSLPnxS\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/*.md\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public\"},\"output\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/context-snapshot.md\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md\",\"metadata\":{\"count\":3,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"\",\"time\":{\"start\":1785690473871,\"end\":1785690474303}},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"fc_047c27cd75a9df54016a6f7969c1a08191b0524a05c952a9a2\"}},\"id\":\"prt_fc372458d0010hGVK1eTgVBQSO\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc37228d1001gfkvceWgWuQU7z\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690474315,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"glob\",\"callID\":\"call_P4uKrXatoMnTyksG54OhKKtn\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/*.md\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public\"},\"output\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/state-reducer-registry.md\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/state-jsonl.md\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/state-outputs.md\\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/state-format.md\",\"metadata\":{\"count\":4,\"truncated\":false},\"title\":\"\",\"time\":{\"start\":1785690473875,\"end\":1785690474312}},\"metadata\":{\"openai\":{\"itemId\":\"fc_047c27cd75a9df54016a6f7969c1ac819196dcb7e953e60ae5\"}},\"id\":\"prt_fc37245900010EpHyIxkNOtdZe\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc37228d1001gfkvceWgWuQU7z\"}}\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1785690475563,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fc3724c280011165ml7OpMeq0Q\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc37228d1001gfkvceWgWuQU7z\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":30999,\"input\":7691,\"output\":163,\"reasoning\":105,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":23040}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1785690479034,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fc37259b8001dUnhaY7Tn8HWfk\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc37250fc001c7hX3O3dp5NeHc\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"snapshot\":\"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc\",\"type\":\"step-start\"}}\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690483175,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_Lue2IWXRZQy25I5PquH5F9tn\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/research.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/research.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: ---\\n2: description: \\\"Autonomous deep-research loop: iterative investigation with convergence detection. Modes :auto, :confirm.\\\"\\n3: argument-hint: \\\"<topic> [:auto|:confirm] [--spec-folder=PATH] [--max-iterations=N] [--convergence=N] [--convergence-mode=default|off|sliding-window|divergent] [--lineage-timeout-hours=N] [--stop-policy=convergence|max-iterations] [--no-resource-map] [--dry-run] [--executor=<type> [--model=X] [--config-dir=PATH] [--reasoning-effort=LEVEL] [--service-tier=TIER] [--executor-timeout=SECONDS] [--iters=N] [--count=N] [--label=X] ...] [--executors=<json>] [--concurrency=N] (:auto supports PRE-BOUND SETUP ANSWERS: prompt-body block for non-interactive setup)\\\"\\n4: ---\\n5: \\n6: # Deep Start Research Loop\\n7: \\n8: Thin router for the deep-research loop. This command verifies the runtime agent, resolves setup and execution mode, loads the presentation contract, then executes the owned workflow YAML.\\n9: \\n10: ## 1. ROUTER CONTRACT\\n11: \\n12: Do not dispatch agents from this Markdown file. Agent dispatch, workflow steps, artifact-writing behavior, convergence detection, synthesis, and memory save behavior are owned by the workflow YAML assets.\\n13: \\n14: Load the presentation contract before showing startup questions, dashboards, checkpoint text, success output, failure output, examples, or next-step prompts.\\n15: \\n16: \\n17: > **EXECUTION PROTOCOL -- READ FIRST**\\n18: >\\n19: > This command runs a structured YAML workflow. Do NOT dispatch agents from this document.\\n20: >\\... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690483189,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_k1ckLIh1IVvRjG96fQoz61if\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml\"},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n2: # DEEP RESEARCH: AUTONOMOUS DEEP RESEARCH LOOP (AUTO MODE)\\n3: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n4: # YAML PREDICATE GRAMMAR CONTRACT (S7 / M11):\\n5: # - This asset does not currently use typed BooleanExpr predicates under\\n6: #   `when:`; flow control is branch-label-driven (`on_resume`, `on_fresh`,\\n7: #   `on_restart`, etc.). Retain the existing shape.\\n8: # - `after:` carries prose timing / narrative notes if needed; `when:` in\\n9: #   this file is reserved for future typed predicates and must NOT carry\\n10: #   free-form narrative prose.\\n11: # - See `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/shared/predicates/boolean-expr.ts`\\n12: #   for the canonical BooleanExpr grammar.\\n13: #\\n14: # GATE 3 CLASSIFICATION (T-YML-DPR-01 / paired with T-DOC-03 R50-001):\\n15: # - `resume` is a tested WRITE-PATH that produces `iteration-NNN.md` files\\n16: #   and JSONL state-log appends. The workflow classifies resume as\\n17: #   write-path below (see `gate3_classification` fields) so Gate 3 trigger\\n18: #   extraction can surface resume correctly rather than false-negative.\\n19: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\\n20: role: Deep Research Loop Manager\\n21: purpose: Iterative deep research with convergence detection\\n22: action: Run deep-research loop from initialization through synthesis\\n23: operating_mode:\\n24:   workflow: iterative_loop\\... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690483190,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_TnKeYbSrQkIsSrI4KYeMkepB\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md\",\"limit\":500},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: ---\\n2: title: Loop Protocol Reference\\n3: description: Canonical specification for the deep research loop lifecycle with 4 phases, reference-only wave orchestration, and error handling.\\n4: trigger_phrases:\\n5:   - \\\"research loop protocol\\\"\\n6:   - \\\"research loop lifecycle\\\"\\n7:   - \\\"research loop initialization\\\"\\n8:   - \\\"research auto resume protocol\\\"\\n9:   - \\\"research pause sentinel\\\"\\n10:   - \\\"research synthesis phase\\\"\\n11: importance_tier: important\\n12: contextType: implementation\\n13: version: 1.14.0.29\\n14: ---\\n15: \\n16: # Loop Protocol Reference\\n17: \\n18: Canonical specification for the deep research loop lifecycle. Use it as the lifecycle map for initialization, iteration, synthesis, save, and recovery.\\n19: \\n20: ---\\n21: \\n22: ## 1. OVERVIEW\\n23: \\n24: ### Purpose\\n25: \\n26: Define the lifecycle contract for deep-research initialization, iteration, synthesis, save, reference-only dispatch concepts, and error handling.\\n27: \\n28: ### When to Use\\n29: \\n30: Load this reference when running or validating the research loop lifecycle. Use `../convergence/convergence.md` for STOP decisions and `../state/state-format.md` for packet file schemas.\\n31: \\n32: ### Core Principle\\n33: \\n34: The YAML workflow owns lifecycle orchestration, `@deep-research` executes LEAF iterations, and the reducer synchronizes packet state after each iteration and lifecycle transition.\\n35: \\n3... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1785690483195,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_lqLbUVCiiUbOZSfykhvS9CbH\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/state-format.md\",\"limit\":350},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/state/state-format.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: ---\\n2: title: State Format Reference\\n3: description: Live state packet hub for the deep-research loop.\\n4: trigger_phrases:\\n5:   - \\\"research state format\\\"\\n6:   - \\\"research state packet hub\\\"\\n7:   - \\\"research file ownership model\\\"\\n8:   - \\\"research file protection rules\\\"\\n9:   - \\\"research packet location\\\"\\n10: importance_tier: important\\n11: contextType: implementation\\n12: version: 1.14.0.29\\n13: ---\\n14: \\n15: # State Format Reference\\n16: \\n17: Live state packet hub for deep-research files, mutability, and routed state references.\\n18: \\n19: ---\\n20: \\n21: ## 1. OVERVIEW\\n22: \\n23: ### Purpose\\n24: \\n25: Summarize the live deep-research packet files, mutability rules, and focused state references without carrying every JSON shape inline.\\n26: \\n27: ### When to Use\\n28: \\n29: Load this hub when navigating packet files, deciding file ownership, or choosing which detailed state reference to load next.\\n30: \\n31: ### Routed Details\\n32: \\n33: - `state-jsonl.md` for config, iteration, event, lifecycle, graph, and blocked-stop records.\\n34: - `state-outputs.md` for strategy, iteration markdown, `research.md`, dashboard, and resource-map output.\\n35: - `state-reducer-registry.md` for reducer ownership, findings registry, validation, reconstruction, and file protection.\\n36: \\n37: For iterative code review state, use `deep-review`. Review-mode state is not part of this skill's live stat... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1785690484510,\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_fc3726f1a0018E902FPBXJH90k\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc\",\"messageID\":\"msg_fc37250fc001c7hX3O3dp5NeHc\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_03c8e1a17ffeXV6F2zK6iNbs8E\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"tokens\":{\"total\":32915,\"input\":2482,\"output\":215,\"reasoning\":10,\"cache\":{\"write\":0,\"read\":30208}},\"cost\":0}}\n{\"type\":\"step_start\",\"time