rompt MUST be the first visible response. No implementation or file-modifying tool calls before asking. Lightweight read-only discovery to suggest a spec folder or load prior context is allowed, then ask ALL questions immediately and wait.\\n10: \\n11: For `:auto`, do not emit the consolidated prompt by default. Resolve setup with the three-tier branch below, then load the auto YAML only after all required values are bound.\\n12: \\n13: ### `:auto` Setup Resolution\\n14: \\n15: Setup contract: see `.opencode/skills/system-spec-kit/references/workflows/auto-mode-contract.md`.\\n16: \\n17: Under `execution_mode = AUTONOMOUS` (from the `:auto` suffix), follow the three-tier flow:\\n18: \\n19: 1. **Tier 1 — Resolve confidently** (contract §1): parse `$ARGUMENTS` flags + `PRE-BOUND SETUP ANSWERS:` block (§2) + the Default Resolution Table... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":41,"totalLines":42,"truncated":true}},"title":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/001-deep-research/research/lineages/luna-fast/logs/fanout-lineage.out","time":{"start":1785692102429,"end":1785692102436}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_09ab96a5c7e3eccc016a6f7fc5b8e88191b97f7e0c330bb59f"}},"id":"prt_fc38b1caf0017FE7sN1YtsODlP","sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","messageID":"msg_fc38b08db00145P1bcfiWtVIEi"}}
