{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785692535047,"sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_sFQjGvu6BrLFZaSpNYSUlX6C","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research announcement claims","prompt":"Execute exactly one LEAF deep-research iteration using the rendered prompt at `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/001-deep-research/research/lineages/luna-fast/prompts/iteration-001.md`. Read the packet config, state JSONL, strategy, and registry before research. Focus only on the supplied Webflow MCP 2.0 announcement and official primary-source confirmation. Use official WebFetch sources, do not call Webflow MCP mutation tools, do not dispatch sub-agents, and write only the packet-local iteration markdown and delta/state append required by the prompt. Verify both outputs and return the agent's iteration completion report.","subagent_type":"deep-research"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_03c71cf09ffe71MXvnRWrmnVK3\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 1 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Webflow MCP 2.0 announcement claims and official confirmation  \n**Findings**: 5 findings (3 new, 2 partially new, 0 redundant)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.80  \n**Questions answered**: Q1 partially; detailed feature gaps identified  \n**Questions remaining**: Q1 partial, Q2–Q5 untouched  \n**Edge cases**: Partial success  \n**Recommended next focus**: Verify unresolved capabilities via official per-tool documentation and changelog entries.\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-001.md`\n- `deltas/iter-001.jsonl`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` — appended exactly one iteration record\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- Delta exists and first line matches state record: yes\n- JSONL append count: 1\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- Webflow MCP mutation tools/sub-agents used: no\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","sessionId":"ses_03c71cf09ffe71MXvnRWrmnVK3","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-luna-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Research announcement claims","time":{"start":1785692304026,"end":1785692535042}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0a86d372e9ac5436016a6f808aea44819188d71d7e9ee26883"}},"id":"prt_fc38e1edc001KXsehfxcplJhpk","sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","messageID":"msg_fc38e0d6f001TY4Kh4UgMI22Wk"}}
