ss -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:questions -->\n## 4. QUESTIONS\n- Answered: 1/5\n- [x] Q1: What did the MCP 2.0 announcement add, and which claims are confirmed by official implementation or developer docs?\n- [ ] Q2: What is the official MCP server surface, transport, client setup, and supported capability boundary? [legacy-import]\n- [ ] Q3: What authentication, OAuth, token, scope, role, and secret-handling rules apply? [legacy-import]\n- [ ] Q4: What operational constraints exist for rate limits, pagination, errors, retries, publishing, and changelog evolution? [legacy-import]\n- [ ] Q5: What safe integration and confirmation model follows for mcp-tooling, including sk-design pairing? [legacy-import]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:questions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:uncovered-questions -->\n## Uncovered Questions\n- Count: 4\n- [ ] Q2: What is the official MCP server surface, transport, client setup, and supported capability boundary?\n- [ ] Q3: What authentication, OAuth, token, scope, role, and secret-handling rules apply?\n- [ ] Q4: What operational constraints exist for rate limits, pagination, errors, retries, publishing, and changelog evolution?\n- [ ] Q5: What safe integration and confirmation model follows for mcp-tooling, including sk-design pairing?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:uncovered-questions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:trend -->\n## 5. TREND\n- newInfoRatio sparkline: ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄\n- score sparkline: ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄\n- Last 3 ratios: 0.80\n- Stuck count: 0\n- Guard violations: none recorded by the reducer pass\n- convergenceScore: 0.80\n- coverageBySources: {\"developers.webflow.com\":2,\"github.com\":1,\"webflow.com\":1}\n- Advisory events: none\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:trend -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:dead-ends -->\n## 6. DEAD ENDS\n- Calling Webflow MCP mutation tools was not attempted because the prompt explicitly forbids tool invocation; therefore no runtime mutation evidence was collected. (iteration 1)\n- Client setup, authentication, transport, rate limits, and safe integration design were deferred because they are separate strategy questions rather than this iteration's announcement-confirmation focus. (iteration 1)\n- Non-official articles, community reports, and broad implementation research were excluded to preserve the supplied official-primary-source scope. (iteration 1)\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:dead-ends -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:divergent-pivots -->\n## 6A. DIVERGENT PIVOTS\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Saturated: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:divergent-pivots -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 7. NEXT FOCUS\nFollow up on: Several “more to offer” claims remain unverified by the official primary sources fetched in this iteration. The docs confirm broad Data API coverage and list CMS, assets, pages, custom code, localization, and Designer...\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:active-risks -->\n## 8. ACTIVE RISKS\n- None active beyond normal research uncertainty.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:active-risks -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:blocked-stops -->\n## 9. BLOCKED STOPS\nNo blocked-stop events recorded.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:blocked-stops -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:graph-convergence -->\n## 10. GRAPH CONVERGENCE\n- graphConvergenceScore: 0.00\n- graphDecision: [Not recorded]\n- graphBlockers: none recorded\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:graph-convergence -->","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":111,"totalLines":111,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/001-deep-research/research/lineages/luna-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1785692622295,"end":1785692622304}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_017cb3b50953e777016a6f81ce01dc8191b6825a2aeb2eb3a6"}},"id":"prt_fc3930d7a001A5nblO20ILpZ8L","sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","messageID":"msg_fc392df7d001qerikcTTF3XUP8"}}
