{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785693714619,"sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_aqQb6gpxmggwmqCHZiSX6Ifx","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research Webflow authentication","prompt":"Execute exactly one LEAF deep-research iteration using `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/001-deep-research/research/lineages/luna-fast/prompts/iteration-003.md`. Read the current state first. Research official Webflow MCP/API authentication, OAuth, token types, scopes, role gates, secret handling, and non-production/staging implications. Use only official Webflow sources, never include credential values, never call Webflow MCP tools, write only lineage-local iteration and delta/state outputs, do not edit reducer-owned files, and do not dispatch sub-agents. Verify the files before returning.","subagent_type":"deep-research"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_03c637199ffeV5uce75MLQOiwE\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 3 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Official Webflow authentication, OAuth, tokens, scopes, roles, secrets, and non-production implications  \n**Findings**: 5 findings (4 new, 1 partial)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.90  \n**Questions answered**: Q3 substantially answered; staging isolation remains undocumented  \n**Edge cases**: Contradictory deployment auth paths; Beta is not confirmed as staging  \n**Recommended next focus**: Q4 operational constraints and changelog evolution  \n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-003.md`\n- `deltas/iter-003.jsonl`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` (exactly one record appended)\n- `research.md` (progressive synthesis enabled)\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- Delta first line matches state record byte-for-byte: yes\n- JSONL append count: 1\n- Finding citations complete: yes\n- Credential values included: no\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Webflow MCP tools/sub-agents used: no\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","sessionId":"ses_03c637199ffeV5uce75MLQOiwE","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-luna-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Research Webflow authentication","time":{"start":1785693245254,"end":1785693714610}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c1c30fc1cbdec94016a6f8437eda08191a90583bb1f5b5af9"}},"id":"prt_fc39c7aba001134A0mqgGdmyZ6","sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","messageID":"msg_fc39c6f02001g5lhS4wDu8BJKB"}}
