{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785694030718,"sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_EzfP5GmJ0GAmFmxhsYgjxbPg","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research Webflow operations","prompt":"Execute exactly one LEAF deep-research iteration using `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/001-deep-research/research/lineages/luna-fast/prompts/iteration-004.md`. Read the current state first. Investigate only official Webflow rate limits, pagination, errors, retries/idempotency, publishing constraints, and changelog evolution. Do not use Webflow MCP tools, credentials, or mutating calls. Write only lineage-local iteration and delta/state outputs, do not edit reducer-owned files, do not dispatch sub-agents, and verify output files before returning.","subagent_type":"deep-research"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_03c5b72c1ffeOktoSC7e4O0Cjl\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 4 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Webflow operational constraints and changelog evolution  \n**Findings**: 6 findings (6 new)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 1.0  \n**Questions answered**: Q4 substantially answered; idempotency and universal pagination remain undocumented  \n**Questions remaining**: 1  \n**Edge cases**: Partial success—invalid guessed documentation paths recovered via official alternatives  \n**Recommended next focus**: Q5 safe integration and confirmation model\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-004.md`\n- `deltas/iter-004.jsonl`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` (exactly one record appended)\n- `research.md` (progressive synthesis)\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- Delta first line matches state record: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- Webflow MCP tools, credentials, and mutating calls used: no\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","sessionId":"ses_03c5b72c1ffeOktoSC7e4O0Cjl","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-luna-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Research Webflow operations","time":{"start":1785693769245,"end":1785694030711}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_008532af4d148fdf016a6f86461fc48191b1b7126fc7680c66"}},"id":"prt_fc3a4822a001wgttWwqdty3449","sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","messageID":"msg_fc3a46850001Lzk0L08bOiNUmm"}}
