{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785694497533,"sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_CBqgTqRCSmKKPlC8rJbV3vKC","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research safe integration model","prompt":"Execute exactly one LEAF deep-research iteration using `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/001-deep-research/research/lineages/luna-fast/prompts/iteration-005.md`. Read current packet state first. Derive an evidence-backed safe mcp-tooling integration and confirmation model, using official Webflow sources plus local hub/sk-design conventions as cited repository evidence. Separate facts from recommendations and preserve unresolved staging, idempotency, and universal-pagination gaps. Do not implement anything, call Webflow tools, use credentials, edit reducer-owned files, or dispatch sub-agents. Write and verify only the lineage-local iteration and delta/state outputs.","subagent_type":"deep-research"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_03c562949ffewXYkLSKtwdfFYx\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 5 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Safe Webflow MCP integration and confirmation model  \n**Findings**: 6 findings (4 new, 2 partially new, 0 redundant)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.93  \n**Questions answered**: Q5 substantially answered  \n**Questions remaining**: Staging isolation, idempotency/replay, and universal pagination  \n**Edge cases**: Partial success  \n**Recommended next focus**: Synthesis; preserve all three unresolved gaps as blockers\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-005.md`\n- `deltas/iter-005.jsonl`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one iteration-5 record appended\n- `research.md` — progressive synthesis updated\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- Delta JSONL valid: yes\n- Delta first line matches state record: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- Webflow tools/credentials/sub-agents used: no\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","sessionId":"ses_03c562949ffewXYkLSKtwdfFYx","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-luna-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Research safe integration model","time":{"start":1785694115728,"end":1785694497524}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0a35c9a78ed6482f016a6f87a07a788191a6ed3898afd3bbba"}},"id":"prt_fc3a9cb1b001GEkeGfXz3ABvqR","sessionID":"ses_03c78660bffecT9HS5m59QDUL4","messageID":"msg_fc3a9bcfc001kanp57KFG3Jr6k"}}
